<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's EDP to become part of PSI index.</title>
<headline>Portugal's EDP to become part of PSI index.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-controlled EDP-Electricidade de Portugal, which is in the process of being partially privatised, will become part of the PSI20 index of leading shares from July 1, the Oporto Derivatives Exchange said.</p>
<p>It was not immediately known which stock would be removed from the index to make room for EDP which will become the biggest company quoted on the Portuguese stock market.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
